        "quote": "(a) The area described in this section is designated as being reserved for exclusive use by motorcycles, motorbikes, minibikes, motor-driven cycles, motor scooters and such other motor- or engine-powered two-, three- or four-wheeled vehicles as may come under this general classification:",
